Tue Aug 25 15:08:30 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Update to upstream LinuxToys 6.6.6:
  * Fix update dialog not displaying correctly on startup when
    fetching up-to-date scripts.
  * Move Distrobox-Adv to the Office category.
  * Add ReBAR capability check to AMD Radeon Drivers (#1146).
  * Rework GRUB-btrfs to create OverlayFS hooks, fixing booting into
    snapshots from the boot menu.
  * Add suse_leap/suse_tumbleweed detection for targeted quirks.
  * Fix upstream issues #1135, #1137, and #1144.
- Keep upstream self-update paths disabled in favor of signed RPM updates.

