Mon Aug 24 17:10:45 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Update to upstream LinuxToys 6.6.5:
  * Detect ROCm and Intel Compute Runtime hardware capabilities.
  * Add native and hybrid-GPU DaVinci Resolve support on Arch Linux.
  * Add Shader Booster support on Solus.
  * Fix upstream issues #1089, #1100, #1104, #1111, #1113, #1118,
    #1121, #1128, and #1130.
- Keep upstream self-update paths disabled in favor of signed RPM updates.

