Thu Aug 20 22:31:44 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Update to upstream LinuxToys 6.6.3:
  * Add VirtualBox to the Developers category.
  * Improve hybrid-GPU feature compatibility handling.
  * Improve Secure Boot module signing on Debian and Ubuntu.
  * Fix v4l2loopback module signing on Fedora and RHEL.
  * Deprecate the RTL88X2BU installer for kernels that provide the driver.
  * Fix upstream issues #1075, #1076, #1085, and #1087.
- Keep upstream self-update paths disabled in favor of signed RPM updates.
- Fail the package check if the About version differs from the RPM version.

